The '''Spray Can''' is a {{Common}} item that can only be used on a [[Private Island]] or [[Marco]]'s [[Canvas Room]]. It requires [[Vanilla Objects/Dyes|Vanilla Dyes]] to function.

== Obtaining ==
=== Quest ===
Complete the [[Quest]] ''Marco the Artist'' by talking to [[Marco]] in the [[Village]].

=== Crafting ===
After completing the [[Quests|Quest]] ''Marco the Artist'', the '''Spray Can''' crafting recipe is unlocked (as shown below):
